## Phase 1.5 — Backend generate-fail recovery

If `jhipster-backend-agent` (Phase 1) errors out partway — no generated code, broken Maven/Gradle build, JDL import failure — there is no separate `jhipster-backend-fix-agent` in the registry. **Use `issue-resolution-agent`** (Vikram Fix) for recovery, exactly the same way it is used in the Phase 2 verify loop. Loop is capped at 3 iterations (not 5) since generate-fail is usually a single root cause; if still failing after 3, hard-block the run with a `blocker` so the user can intervene. Do **not** invent a missing agent slug — Task tool will return a cryptic error and the pipeline will hang.

